        {
          "id": "I148:542;147:266",
          "name": "Project story",
          "w": 1088,
          "h": 50,
          "text": "We reconsidered the initial interface about five hours into development. The process involved sketches, visual experiments, and scope decisions under a deadline. These early artifacts show how the product’s structure and personality developed.",
