    {
      "id": "148:561",
      "name": "Lessons from the build",
      "w": 1088,
      "h": 188,
      "layout": "HORIZONTAL",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "148:562",
          "name": "Case study / Narrative section",
          "w": 524,
          "h": 188,
          "layout": "VERTICAL",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "I148:562;147:265",
              "name": "Project section",
              "w": 524,
              "h": 55,
              "text": "The hard parts",
              "font": {
                "family": "Instrument Serif",
                "style": "Regular"
              },
              "size": 38,
              "link": null
            },
            {
              "id": "I148:562;147:266",
              "name": "Project story",
              "w": 524,
              "h": 125,
              "text": "The team had to shape AI output so it could support the interface, coordinate changes across branches, recover from deployment problems, and choose which features belonged in the core experience. Clear communication mattered as much as the tools.",
              "font": {
                "family": "Inter",
                "style": "Regular",
                "variationSettings": {
                  "wght": 400,
                  "slnt": 0
                }
              },
              "size": 17,
              "link": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "148:565",
          "name": "Case study / Narrative section",
          "w": 524,
          "h": 163,
          "layout": "VERTICAL",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "I148:565;147:265",
              "name": "Project section",
              "w": 524,
              "h": 55,
              "text": "What I’m taking forward",
              "font": {
                "family": "Instrument Serif",
                "style": "Regular"
              },
              "size": 38,
              "link": null
            },
            {
              "id": "I148:565;147:266",
              "name": "Project story",
              "w": 524,
              "h": 100,
              "text": "A learning tool needs more than a fast answer. It needs a useful next step. I would keep refining the mentor’s guidance, test the onboarding and project flow with learners, and explore a wider range of projects and learning resources.",
              "font": {
                "family": "Inter",
                "style": "Regular",
                "variationSettings": {
                  "wght": 400,
                  "slnt": 0
                }
              },
              "size": 17,
              "link": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
