        },
        {
          "id": "I148:568;147:266",
          "name": "Project story",
          "w": 1088,
          "h": 75,
          "text": "BluePrint moved beyond a static concept into a working web application. The Figma screens document the design direction; the repository and deployed demo let visitors explore the implementation. This is a hackathon-stage product, with further usability evaluation still ahead.",
          "font": {
